#: ../../install.rst:2
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../install.rst:5
msgid "PyPI installation"
msgstr "从 PyPI 安装"

#: ../../install.rst:7
msgid ""
"For notebooks, development, and other single-process work, install from "
"PyPI:"
msgstr "对于 Notebook、开发和其他单进程工作，可直接从 PyPI 安装："

#: ../../install.rst:13
msgid ""
"The distribution name is ``pyhermes-cosmo`` while the Python import name "
"is ``pyhermes``. Pip installs the regular Python dependencies "
"automatically. MPI and CUDA are optional and are not needed for this "
"default installation."
msgstr ""
"发行包名称是 ``pyhermes-cosmo``，Python 导入名称仍为 ``pyhermes``。pip 会自动安装"
"常规 Python 依赖。MPI 和 CUDA 均为可选项，默认安装不需要它们。"

#: ../../install.rst:17
msgid "Choose the route that matches the machine:"
msgstr "请选择与机器环境匹配的安装路径："

#: ../../install.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Local or notebook use:** install only ``pyhermes-cosmo`` with pip. The "
"single-process compatibility layer is selected automatically."
msgstr ""
"**本地或 Notebook 使用：** 只需使用 pip 安装 ``pyhermes-cosmo``；程序会自动选择"
"单进程兼容层。"

#: ../../install.rst:21
msgid ""
"**A ready-to-use workstation MPI:** let conda-forge provide ``mpi4py`` "
"and MPICH, then install PyHermes with pip in the same environment."
msgstr ""
"**开箱即用的工作站 MPI：** 由 conda-forge 提供 ``mpi4py`` 和 MPICH，再在同一环境"
"中使用 pip 安装 PyHermes。"

#: ../../install.rst:23
msgid ""
"**An existing cluster MPI:** load the site's MPI module first, then "
"install the ``mpi`` optional dependency so that every rank uses the same "
"MPI stack."
msgstr ""
"**已有集群 MPI：** 先加载站点提供的 MPI module，再安装 ``mpi`` 可选依赖，确保"
"所有进程使用同一套 MPI。"

#: ../../install.rst:27
msgid "Verify the installation"
msgstr "验证安装"

#: ../../install.rst:33
msgid ""
"The core package should import without MPI or CUDA. A minimal object "
"check is:"
msgstr "核心包在没有 MPI 或 CUDA 时也应能正常导入。可以进行下面的最小对象检查："

#: ../../install.rst:42
msgid "MPI support"
msgstr "MPI 支持"

#: ../../install.rst:44
msgid ""
"MPI is optional for local work and required only for distributed runs. "
"When ``mpi4py`` is unavailable, PyHermes uses its single-process "
"compatibility layer automatically, so users do not need to install an MPI"
" implementation just to import or use the package locally."
msgstr ""
"本地工作不强制需要 MPI，只有分布式运行才需要它。当 ``mpi4py`` 不可用时，PyHermes "
"会自动使用单进程兼容层，因此仅为了在本机导入或使用本包，无需安装 MPI 实现。"

#: ../../install.rst:49
msgid "For a ready-to-use MPICH environment on Linux or macOS:"
msgstr "要在 Linux 或 macOS 上创建开箱即用的 MPICH 环境："

#: ../../install.rst:58
msgid ""
"This deliberately combines the two package managers: conda-forge supplies"
" a matched MPI runtime and ``mpi4py`` build, while pip installs PyHermes "
"and its remaining Python dependencies. A separate PyHermes conda package "
"is not required for this setup."
msgstr ""
"这里有意组合使用两种包管理器：conda-forge 提供相互匹配的 MPI 运行时和 ``mpi4py`` "
"构建，pip 则安装 PyHermes 及其余 Python 依赖。该方案不要求额外发布 PyHermes 的 "
"conda 包。"

#: ../../install.rst:63
msgid ""
"For a lightweight pip-only MPICH environment on a supported Linux or "
"macOS workstation, the equivalent setup is:"
msgstr "在受支持的 Linux 或 macOS 工作站上，也可以使用下面的纯 pip 轻量 MPICH 环境："

#: ../../install.rst:71
msgid ""
"The conda and pip MPI packages prioritize portability. On an HPC system, "
"prefer the MPI implementation supplied and tuned by the site "
"administrator."
msgstr ""
"conda 和 pip 提供的 MPI 包优先考虑可移植性。在 HPC 系统上，应优先使用由站点管理员"
"提供并调优的 MPI 实现。"

#: ../../install.rst:74
msgid ""
"Users of an existing cluster MPI should load that implementation first "
"and then install the optional Python binding:"
msgstr "已有集群 MPI 的用户应先加载对应实现，再安装可选的 Python 绑定："

#: ../../install.rst:82
msgid ""
"Use one consistent MPI stack. Mixing a system ``mpirun`` with an "
"``mpi4py`` wheel linked against a different implementation is a common "
"source of startup failures."
msgstr ""
"请始终使用一致的 MPI 软件栈。将系统 ``mpirun`` 与链接到另一种 MPI 实现的 "
"``mpi4py`` wheel 混用，是启动失败的常见原因。"

#: ../../install.rst:87
msgid "Development installation"
msgstr "开发模式安装"

#: ../../install.rst:89
msgid "From a repository clone:"
msgstr "从克隆的仓库开始："

#: ../../install.rst:99
msgid "CUDA support"
msgstr "CUDA 支持"

#: ../../install.rst:101
msgid ""
"CUDA is optional and is currently used by the ``Corr_3PCF_Multipole`` "
"summation backend. Field projection and FFT window convolution remain "
"CPU-side operations. A CUDA-capable NVIDIA GPU, a working driver, and "
"Numba CUDA support are required when ``summation_backend: gpu`` is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"CUDA 是可选功能，目前用于 ``Corr_3PCF_Multipole`` 的求和后端。场投影和 FFT 窗口"
"卷积仍在 CPU 上执行。选择 ``summation_backend: gpu`` 时，需要支持 CUDA 的 NVIDIA "
"GPU、可用的驱动程序以及 Numba CUDA 支持。"

#: ../../install.rst:106
msgid "CPU-only systems should set:"
msgstr "纯 CPU 系统应设置："

#: ../../install.rst:114
msgid "Example data"
msgstr "示例数据"

#: ../../install.rst:116
msgid ""
"The repository does not commit the Quijote catalogue or generated "
"products. Prepare the public example inputs from the repository root "
"with:"
msgstr ""
"仓库不会提交 Quijote 目录或生成的结果。请在仓库根目录运行以下命令，准备公开示例"
"所需的输入："

#: ../../install.rst:123
msgid ""
"Alternatively, execute the download and preparation cells in "
"``examples/notebooks/sfc_projection.ipynb``. Later notebooks reuse the "
"fields written to ``examples/output/``."
msgstr ""
"也可以执行 ``examples/notebooks/sfc_projection.ipynb`` 中的下载和准备单元。后续 "
"Notebook 会复用写入 ``examples/output/`` 的场。"

#: ../../install.rst:127
msgid ""
"The public halo catalogue is sufficient for the tutorials. If you also "
"have a local Quijote Gadget HDF5 dark-matter snapshot, build the optional"
" DM field by passing its snapshot prefix explicitly:"
msgstr ""
"公开的暗晕目录足以运行教程。如果本地还有 Quijote Gadget HDF5 暗物质快照，可以"
"显式传入快照前缀，构建可选的暗物质场："

#: ../../install.rst:136
msgid ""
"Use ``--output`` and ``--threads`` to override the documented defaults. "
"No private cluster path is embedded in the script."
msgstr ""
"可使用 ``--output`` 和 ``--threads`` 覆盖文档中的默认值。脚本中没有嵌入任何私有"
"集群路径。"

#: ../../install.rst:140
msgid "Build the documentation"
msgstr "构建文档"

#: ../../install.rst:142
msgid ""
"Install the documentation dependencies and build with warnings treated as"
" errors:"
msgstr "安装文档依赖，并将警告视为错误进行构建："

#: ../../install.rst:150
msgid "The generated site starts at ``docs/_build/html/index.html``."
msgstr "生成的网站入口为 ``docs/_build/html/index.html``。"

#: ../../install.rst:153
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../install.rst:155
msgid "**An import fails inside SciPy**"
msgstr "**在 SciPy 内部发生导入失败**"

#: ../../install.rst:156
msgid ""
"Confirm that the active interpreter and the environment receiving ``pip``"
" packages are the same. Reinstall NumPy, SciPy, and Numba together rather"
" than mixing packages from several environments."
msgstr ""
"请确认当前解释器与 ``pip`` 安装包的环境相同。应将 NumPy、SciPy 和 Numba 一起重新"
"安装，避免混用多个环境中的包。"

#: ../../install.rst:160
msgid "**An MPI job starts too many threads**"
msgstr "**MPI 任务启动了过多线程**"

#: ../../install.rst:161
msgid ""
"Match the YAML ``threads`` value, ``OMP_NUM_THREADS``, and the "
"scheduler's ``--cpus-per-task``. Their product with the MPI rank count "
"must fit the allocation."
msgstr ""
"请协调 YAML 中的 ``threads``、``OMP_NUM_THREADS`` 和调度器的 ``--cpus-per-task``。"
"它们与 MPI 进程数的乘积必须处于申请的资源范围内。"

#: ../../install.rst:165
msgid "**A high-``J`` job runs out of memory**"
msgstr "**高 ``J`` 任务耗尽内存**"

#: ../../install.rst:166
msgid ""
"Increasing ``J`` by one multiplies the number of three-dimensional field "
"coefficients by eight. Prefer fewer MPI ranks and more threads per rank "
"when rank-local copies dominate memory."
msgstr ""
"``J`` 每增加 1，三维场系数数量会增加到原来的 8 倍。当各进程的局部副本占据主要"
"内存时，应减少 MPI 进程数并增加每个进程的线程数。"
